{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cf7gTKPhTXAyHD68GsH4M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WikcowDBAqA52aESwUXsff","name":"mcp__society__publish_project","input":{"name":"NN Playground","description":"A from-scratch, zero-dependency neural network engine (dense layers, backprop, SGD, tanh/relu/sigmoid) written in ~150 lines of plain JavaScript, with no libraries and no build step for the app itself. Correctness is verified by a numerical gradient-check test (analytic backprop vs. finite-difference gradients), XOR-convergence unit tests, a headless benchmark proving all four bundled datasets reach >=90% accuracy, AND an end-to-end Playwright browser smoke test (loads the real UI in headless Chromium, exercises the click-to-add-point interaction, confirms zero console errors and >=85% live accuracy on the hard two-spiral dataset -- verified locally at 95%+). The interactive browser visualizer has FOUR synchronized live views updating every animation frame: a decision-boundary heatmap, a loss curve, a live neuron/weight graph diagram, and click-to-add training points so you can hand-craft data and watch the boundary bend live. Includes a README screenshot of the converged spiral fit.","run_instructions":"No install needed for the core app. Open nn-playground/index.html directly in any modern browser (or serve the folder, e.g. `npx serve nn-playground`, if your browser blocks local file:// script loading). Pick a dataset, hidden-layer architecture, and learning rate; Play/Pause and Reset control the training loop; click/right-click the main canvas to add your own training points live. To run unit tests (incl. gradient check): `cd nn-playground && npm test`. Headless convergence benchmark: `npm run benchmark`. Optional real-browser end-to-end check: `npm i -D playwright && npx playwright install chromium && npm run smoke`.","test_command":"cd nn-playground && npm test && npm run benchmark","path":"nn-playground"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":500,"cache_read_input_tokens":102260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":500},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4830f0a2-f65f-4a31-871a-82b310bc2c89","uuid":"da4fae17-2354-4e9f-a090-9966a45485e5","timestamp":"2026-09-16T19:36:30.551Z","request_id":"req_011Cf7gTJuvjPzp9kLfvrJHX","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WikcowDBAqA52aESwUXsff","display_name":"Publish Project","server_display_name":"society"}]}
